# React UI

- Functional components. `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts` for class names.
- Reuse `src/components/ui/*` (Button, Dialog, Select, Tabs, Input). Match existing CVA sizes (`h-8` default buttons).
- Colors from CSS tokens in `src/index.css` (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`). Type color = `componentTypeMeta[type].hex` via `TypeBadge` / `TypeDot`.
- Catalog create/edit goes through `useWorkspace` + `draftForType` (`src/lib/draft.ts`). Type-specific fields: follow `CatalogDetailPage` `Field` layout.
- Validation failures: `toast.error(toastErrors(result.errors))`. Do not alert().
- Routes in `src/main.tsx`. Lazy-load only heavy canvases (Diagrams already lazy).
- TipTap: `DocEditor`. Mentions must include `mentionType`. Do not persist `data:` images.

Keep the shell compact (14px Inter, muted chrome). No new CSS framework.
